Package: kulan-update-center
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: @PUBLISHER@ <@MAINTAINER_EMAIL@>
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Depends: kulan-base (= @VERSION@), python3 (>= 3.11), pkexec, apt, timeshift, lynis
Recommends: unattended-upgrades, kulan-settings (= @VERSION@)
Homepage: @HOME_URL@
Description: @NAME@ updates, add-ons and restore points
 The parts of @NAME@'s update system that run as root: the update status
 kept current by apt's hooks, the password-protected helper that installs
 updates and add-ons, and the add-on list. Kulan Settings ("Updates and
 recovery") and the top-bar indicator show and use them.
 .
 Also sets up daily restore points with Timeshift, so the system can be
 rolled back if an update ever causes trouble.
